==Macedonian==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|mk|sla-pro|*per-}}.

===Prefix===
{{head|mk|prefix}}

# [[too]], [[overly]], [[excessively]]
#: {{prefixusex|mk|голем|преголем|t1=big|t2=too big}}
# [[re-]], [[again]]
#: {{prefixusex|mk|прати|препрати|t1=to send|t2=to resend, forward}}
# [[across]], [[over]], [[through]]
#: {{prefixusex|mk|качи|прекачи|t1=to climb|t2=to climb over}}
#: {{prefixusex|mk|носи|пренесе|t1=to carry|t2=to transfer, transport, carry across}}

